[en.FOCUS_C12_FORMAL_VISIT_TO_APPLELOOSA]
Formal Visit to Appleloosa

[en.FOCUS_C12_FORMAL_VISIT_TO_APPLELOOSA_desc]
With the rock farm revitalized and everything falling into place, it was time to take advantage of this rare moment of leisure. As leaders of the land and friends who had shared many good times together, it was time to pay a visit to Appleoosa and engage in some heartfelt communication.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_FORMAL_VISIT_TO_APPLELOOSA]
正式出访苹果鲁萨

[zh.FOCUS_C12_FORMAL_VISIT_TO_APPLELOOSA_desc]
采石农场已经焕然一新了，一切都在步入正轨，在这难得的空暇时光，是时候以这片土地上的领导马和曾经共同经历过美好时光的朋友的身份，对苹果鲁萨进行一次访问，好好交流一下感情。


[l_english.FOCUS_C12_FORMAL_VISIT_TO_APPLELOOSA_TOOLTIP]
A series of resolutions will be unlocked. §C Deepen our friendship with Appleloosa §! to promote the unification between the two regions.

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_FORMAL_VISIT_TO_APPLELOOSA_TOOLTIP]
一系列决议将解锁，我们将§C深化与苹果鲁萨的友谊§!来促进俩地之间的统一
